{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"What it is, three, four days after I sink my claws into her?\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:25:15.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738673621446295582","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"And now she is dead, and you remain behind to live your second chance.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:25:36.603000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738673711028371589","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"And she goes gallavanting after glory on a suicide mission. I don't think it was glory she was after.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:25:57.566000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738673798953304124","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"Baeshra kisses Web back. Her eyes shut briefly, but open again as Goan speaks.","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:26:25.873000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738673917681729547","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"736489857928396840","content":"\"I'm sorry. I cared for her deeply. And I swore to Castor to give her sanctuary. It is I who failed her.\"","created_at":"2020-07-31T08:27:03.203000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738674074254966806","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
